00:24:03,141 --> 00:24:09,300
Night on the planet Mercury can be as cold as minus 280 degrees Fahrenheit,

382
00:24:10,360 --> 00:24:12,520
1,000 degrees colder than during the day.

383
00:24:13,440 --> 00:24:16,900
It's the greatest night-to-day temperature variation within our solar system.

384
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:20,680
Night will return on Modern Marvels.

385
00:24:24,780 --> 00:24:29,420
Since the invention of light bulbs, we have pushed back the night to an incredible degree.

386
00:24:29,421 --> 00:24:33,860
150 years ago, when the sun went down, it was dark.

387
00:24:33,861 --> 00:24:35,420
But we've changed that.

