00:24:37,661 --> 00:24:40,940
from actual NASA satellites, we can see how humans have used

390
00:24:40,941 --> 00:24:44,660
billions of light bulbs to try to drive away the darkness.

391
00:24:44,661 --> 00:24:47,500
But today, even with the millions of street lights,

392
00:24:47,501 --> 00:24:50,180
porch lights, and security lights,

393
00:24:50,181 --> 00:24:53,180
and all the other lights in our cities and suburbs,

394
00:24:53,181 --> 00:24:57,340
pockets of darkness still exist where trouble can brew.

