00:26:32,000 --> 00:26:34,620
which is one of the technologies that we use at night

423
00:26:34,621 --> 00:26:37,840
that requires absolutely no ambient lighting at all.

424
00:26:38,700 --> 00:26:41,460
The FLIR system itself works on the infrared spectrum,

425
00:26:42,400 --> 00:26:45,760
which is basically a thermal imaging system.

