00:33:18,440 --> 00:33:21,660
In this case, a high-pressure mixture of argon, mercury,

538
00:33:21,860 --> 00:33:25,640
and a variety of halogen compounds called metal halides.

539
00:33:25,641 --> 00:33:32,900
here we have an example of a sports light here at PNC Park we have 616 of them we have an optic

